uTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","review_id":"9fjYVv9qRcSh9Oz-SZuW7w","date":"2021-10-13T14:43:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9220189452171326,"text_excerpt":"Since this California girl doesn't really eat breakfast, it was really early and my appetite still wasn't awake. We chose this place because it was close to our hotel and had some interesting menu items, specifically alligator. I ordered the biscuits and sausage gravy. It was quite filling. The sausage has a slight heat and the gravy was flavorful. My friend opted for the alligator sausage and a side of grits. She described it as flavorful but a little greasy. It's a cute place. The staff was friendly. There was a constant flow of people I coming in while we were seated, including the local sheriff. I would check it out."},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","review_id":"ooULcRG66WlqKROB59Gs9w","date":"2021-11-01T16:12:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9220125079154968,"text_excerpt":"My wife & I are on vacation and we're going on a long excursion. I figured a big breakfast will hold us over, Daisy Mae's here we come! Walking inside, it's an eclectic space with lots of New Orleans paraphernalia. We grab a table and I zero in on Chicken & Waffles. Mmm mm! I didn't see anything funky like gator and waffles, nothing like going on a gator tour with a belly full of gator. The chicken and waffles were good, I can see why people dig this spot. We had a nice breakfast here, enjoy"},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","review_id":"eUcw0dxTAQLA3FSYP6gKNQ","date":"2019-06-26T10:33:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9188210964202881,"text_excerpt":"Came here on a Saturday morning and the place was almost full. I had a good feeling that this was \"the\" place to be. My friend ordered a bloody mary which apparently has free refills?? WOW. We also got some fried chicken and potato salad, shrimp and grits and a seafood omelette. Needless to say, all the food was excellent, the server was still very attentive even though the place was busy, and he must've refilled my friend's bloody mary at least twice and offered him a to go cup. Now that's good service. If I'm ever back in NOLA this place is going to be on my to go list. There's a reason why their yelp reviews are so good - try it out for yourself."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","photo_id":"QSpaT8kzt_EKnfpamspmfw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QSpaT8kzt_EKnfpamspmfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8758976459503174},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","photo_id":"1p_ofSXHdCoonq0Ht_XQ7w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1p_ofSXHdCoonq0Ht_XQ7w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8646199703216553},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","photo_id":"1rrIiw3QKaW3cmvWYHXfpg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/1rrIiw3QKaW3cmvWYHXfpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8331845998764038},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","photo_id":"WjTHNQ6Bgx45Y1KgfmHM0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WjTHNQ6Bgx45Y1KgfmHM0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7945060729980469},{"business_id":"ZapDvyE7lJxVxlmeeKyjkg","photo_id":"ur98pnXkP1BBci_H__XHag","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ur98pnXkP1BBci_H__XHag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7842991352081299}]},"notebook_